description: 'Trigger ONLY when the user requests suggesting, creating, or curating
  AppSec (CAS/ASPM) business applications by grouping source code repositories - proposing
  groupings for ungrouped repos, creating the approved applications, and managing
  membership additions, removals, and reverts. Examples: "suggest how to group my
  repos into applications", "add repos to the payments app", "undo that membership
  change". Do not activate for asset group creation outside AppSec, cloud asset inventory,
  or non-AppSec grouping requests.'
